{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/37355c6ac7b0e7743a953a46701ba84c.poster.avif?t=1774116562\" width=414 height=52 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/37355c6ac7b0e7743a953a46701ba84c.webm?t=1774116562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/37355c6ac7b0e7743a953a46701ba84c.mp4?t=1774116562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the Drone Football League</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of combat drones and dominate the pitch in <i>Dronaldo</i>, the thrilling televised spectacle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending fast-paced sports action with class-based shooter mechanics, <i>Dronaldo</i> delivers explosive abilities, unpredictable physics, and nonstop competitive chaos in every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/29c605e99c2da69e7aff564910d823d7.poster.avif?t=1774116562\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/29c605e99c2da69e7aff564910d823d7.webm?t=1774116562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/29c605e99c2da69e7aff564910d823d7.mp4?t=1774116562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete in High-Octane Matches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into quick matches or dive into a story-driven campaign packed with charming characters and non-stop action. Rise through the ranks, steal the spotlight, and prove you\u2019ve got what it takes to become the next Drone Football League star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/d04d71cc4cb3e8b05965a54907bba1d9.poster.avif?t=1774116562\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/d04d71cc4cb3e8b05965a54907bba1d9.webm?t=1774116562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/d04d71cc4cb3e8b05965a54907bba1d9.mp4?t=1774116562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unleash Chaos on the Field</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful abilities to attack rival drones, traverse dynamic arenas, and outplay your opponents with strategy, skill, and smart positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/fdaddb7efab947b6636292d1746b9ad4.poster.avif?t=1774116562\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/fdaddb7efab947b6636292d1746b9ad4.webm?t=1774116562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/fdaddb7efab947b6636292d1746b9ad4.mp4?t=1774116562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go head-to-head online &amp; in local split-screen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your skills online and battle other wannabe drone football stars in quick, explosive matches - or dust off that second remote and challenge your friends to splitscreen carnage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Drone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine-tune your playstyle by distributing mastery points across key stats, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooldown</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reload</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suppression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regeneration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autonomy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a drone that fits how you want to play - fast, tanky, tactical, or just pure chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Your Squad</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not alone on the field. Build and manage your squad to create the perfect team composition. Focus on offense, defense, or craft a completely unique strategy - the decision is in your hands!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3491420?t=1774116562","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3491420?t=1774116562","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/0b5da37168b7a5b247d4e6981c9432a210d475cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774116562","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/0b5da37168b7a5b247d4e6981c9432a210d475cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774116562","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full