h charming characters and non-stop action. Rise through the ranks, steal the spotlight, and prove you\u2019ve got what it takes to become the next Drone Football League star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/d04d71cc4cb3e8b05965a54907bba1d9.poster.avif?t=1774116562\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/d04d71cc4cb3e8b05965a54907bba1d9.webm?t=1774116562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/d04d71cc4cb3e8b05965a54907bba1d9.mp4?t=1774116562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unleash Chaos on the Field</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful abilities to attack rival drones, traverse dynamic arenas, and outplay your opponents with strategy, skill, and smart positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/fdaddb7efab947b6636292d1746b9ad4.poster.avif?t=1774116562\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/fdaddb7efab947b6636292d1746b9ad4.webm?t=1774116562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/extras/fdaddb7efab947b6636292d1746b9ad4.mp4?t=1774116562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go head-to-head online &amp; in local split-screen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your skills online and battle other wannabe drone football stars in quick, explosive matches - or dust off that second remote and challenge your friends to splitscreen carnage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Drone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine-tune your playstyle by distributing mastery points across key stats, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooldown</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reload</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suppression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regeneration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autonomy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a drone that fits how you want to play - fast, tanky, tactical, or just pure chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Your Squad</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not alone on the field. Build and manage your squad to create the perfect team composition. Focus on offense, defense, or craft a completely unique strategy - the decision is in your hands!</p>","developers":["The Koala Republic"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491420/523343d357b1427ced99cf37280a9e1475c7a44d/header.jpg?t=1774116562","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz Dual core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 760, AMD Radeon R7 270X, or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.0+ GHz Quad core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeF